Assembly    Packer
SourceFiles main

# File-operation verbs hang off any phase hook (see example 09 for the phase
# order). This build stages the finished executable plus a version note into
# a dist/ folder - a miniature "package" step.

# Copy's second argument is a destination DIRECTORY (the file keeps its name):
PostBuild.NewDir dist
PostBuild.Copy   Build/Packer.exe dist

PostBuild.WriteFile dist/README.txt
{
Packer - built by RiftBuild.
Unzip anywhere and run Packer.exe.
}

# The full verb set: NewDir, NewFile, WriteFile, AppendFile, Copy, Rename,
# Delete, and Cmd (run any command). A quick Rename/Delete demo:
PostBuild.NewFile scratch.tmp
PostBuild.Rename  scratch.tmp notes.tmp
PostBuild.Delete  notes.tmp
